<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Sircilla 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes hydraulic ramp trailers safer than traditional car carriers for transportation in Sircilla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers eliminate the need for manual winches, reducing human error during loading and unloading. The smooth, motor‑driven ramp aligns perfectly with a vehicle’s chassis, preventing wheel damage. Combined with the company’s 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, this technology ensures a scratch‑free journey, fulfilling the zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my car from Sircilla by train instead of road, and how does the cost compare?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad offers car shifting by train as an alternative to road transport. Rail freight typically reduces fuel surcharges but may involve additional handling fees at terminals. Overall, the cost difference is marginal, and the choice depends on delivery speed preferences and personal convenience.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the zero transit scratch guarantee protect my vehicle during the 850 km journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The guarantee is backed by a multi‑layer protection system: 80‑GSM bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, and stretch film. Each layer cushions impacts, while the hydraulic ramp ensures gentle loading. If any scratch occurs, the company reimburses repair costs up to the declared value, as per IRDAI‑approved insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation do I need to provide for car transportation in Sircilla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued identity proof, GSTIN (if applicable), and a signed consignment note. For corporate moves, an e‑Way bill is mandatory. The service team also prepares an insurance declaration form, ensuring compliance with Indian Banks Association mover code and ISO standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is real‑time tracking available for my car while it travels from Sircilla to the major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every Shree Ashirwad truck is equipped with satellite GPS that provides live location updates. Clients receive a secure link to monitor progress in real time, along with estimated arrival notifications. This transparency aligns with the primary keyword “Car Transportation In Sircilla” and enhances trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How quickly can I get an instant car shifting quote for a move from Sircilla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The instant quote system processes your request within minutes. By entering pickup and drop‑off locations, vehicle dimensions, and any special handling needs, the algorithm calculates base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, and optional services. You’ll receive a detailed, itemized estimate instantly, enabling fast decision‑making.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the car delivery service in Sircilla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that protects the declared value of your vehicle against loss, theft, or damage. The policy is automatically applied at booking, and you can opt for higher coverage limits if desired. This comprehensive coverage ensures peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
